{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2015-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1423353600, "end_date": 1423958399, "month_true_total": 37, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:50:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "14462459", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040298199", "personaname": "Theodamus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040298199/", "num_games_owned": 341, "num_reviews": 72, "playtime_forever": 1409, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1367, "last_played": 1497819849, "avatar": "394c41c6991f26d3e9bf6006d8721211a2015089"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great combat, decent/good story even if you aren't into the 40k universe you'll still have a blast!\nAdditional note you can get this game for 8 dollars physical edition then just plug the code into steam http://www.amazon.com/Warhammer-40k-Space-Marine-PC/dp/B003TIVSM4/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&qid=1423917973&sr=8-1&keywords=space+marine+the+video+game !", "timestamp_created": 1423918011, "timestamp_updated": 1423918011, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523672878742218018", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14438640", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043853617", "personaname": "Steel Centipede", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043853617/", "num_games_owned": 209, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1981, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 317, "last_played": 1685649058, "avatar": "e1b32d93250e61b2e0998344e56356538bed6b94"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine is a great third person shooter set in universe and is the first game to make you really feel like a space marine. The shooting holds up and so does the hack and slash aspect but unfortunately the multiplayer is basically dead, can still get a game but only in exterminatus mode but the single player sells this game by itself. still fun to shoot up some orks with friends though.", "timestamp_created": 1423782754, "timestamp_updated": 1423782754, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "14423334", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104516986", "personaname": "Crim/9-Ball", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ShotgunIce/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7572, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1141, "last_played": 1761612221, "avatar": "b1f27a65323a1c581bd132864b459c70a394feb5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warhammer40K. A game with a rich history and historic battles. This game let's you BE one of those Marines that you command on the ground. I've heard about the series for years. But I've never had a chance to experience the  Ultramarines until now. I'd recommend this game to anyone who wants to simply destroy everything in your path in the most satisfying way possible. It's you against entire Hoards.  Gotta love those odds. That's where you call upon the will of the emperor and tear the scourge to shreds in holy fury.   This is a great start to get into the War Hammer40K series. I recommend it", "timestamp_created": 1423601511, "timestamp_updated": 1423601511, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primaril